:Railroads created virtually every major American industry: coal, oil, gas, steel, lumber, farm equipment, grain, cotton, textile factories, California citrus.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Harriman vs. Hill: Wall Street's Great Railroad War War - Google Search |url={{google books|plainurl=y|id=ZpKnngEACAAJ}}|access-date=2024-12-06 |website=www.google.com |language=en}}</ref>{{rp| 7}}
